  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "用語の聞き流し、法務・標準化編なのだ。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "略語を読み上げたら、少し間をあけるわね。意味を思い浮かべてから答えを聞いてね。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "JIS。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Japanese Industrial Standards。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "日本産業規格"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "ISO。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "International Organization for Standardization。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "国際標準化機構"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "IEC。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "International Electrotechnical Commission。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "国際電気標準会議"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "IEEE。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "米国電気電子学会。LAN規格（IEEE 802）を定める",
   "yomi": "米国電気電子学会。LAN規格、IEEE 802、を定める"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "IETF。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Internet Engineering Task Force。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "インターネット技術の標準（RFC）を策定する組織",
   "yomi": "インターネット技術の標準、RFC、を策定する組織"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "W3C。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "World Wide Web Consortium。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Web技術（HTML等）の標準化団体",
   "yomi": "Web技術、HTML等、の標準化団体"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "RFC。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Request For Comments。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "IETFが発行するインターネット技術の仕様文書"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "GDPR。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "General Data Protection Regulation。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "EU一般データ保護規則"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "PL法。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Product Liability（製造物責任法）。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "製品の欠陥による損害について製造業者の責任を定める法律"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "SLA（契約）。",
   "yomi": "エスエルエー。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Service Level Agreement。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "法務でもサービス品質の契約条件として出題される"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "metan",
   "text": "NDA。"
  },
  {
   "pause": 1.5
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "Non-Disclosure Agreement。"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "zundamon",
   "text": "秘密保持契約（再掲）",
